# Development overrides of the Excel add-in. `.env.development` gives every other variable.
#
# The task pane uses HTTPS. WebKit refuses a plain-HTTP request from an HTTPS page, so Excel cannot
# call the local Dust on `http://localhost:3000`. Dust is therefore called on the add-in origin,
# and the dev server proxies `/api` to the local Dust (see `platforms/excel/webpack.config.ts`).
#
# Every `DUST_API_URL_*` variable must stay listed here: `getImportMetaEnv` reads this file alone.
DUST_US_URL="https://localhost:3014"
DUST_EU_URL="https://localhost:3014"
DUST_API_URL_US="https://localhost:3014"
DUST_API_URL_EU="https://localhost:3014"
DUST_API_URL_CELL_00002="https://localhost:3014"
